      "name": "Special Offers",
      "settings": {
        "promo_title": "Manufacturer Rebates",
        "promo_subtitle": "Major tire manufacturers offer tire rebate promotions twice per year, typically during the spring tire season and winter tire season when drivers are switching their tires. Leading brands such as Michelin, Bridgestone, Goodyear, Pirelli, and Continental commonly provide seasonal tire rebates when customers purchase a set of four tires, making these promotions the best time to find discounted tires and the best tire deals.",
        "promo_image": "shopify://shop_images/BIG_BRANDS_BIGGER_REBATES.gif",
        "promo_image_mobile": "shopify://shop_images/BIG_BRANDS_BIGGER_REBATES.gif",
        "end_date": "May 31st 2026, Kumho Ends June 15th and Laufenn Ends June 30th.",
        "check_vehicle_url": "shopify://pages/offer-page",
        "check_vehicle_text": "How Much Is The Rebate?",
        "promo_description": "<p>Spring tire rebate offers from major manufacturers typically range from <strong>$40 to $200 when purchasing a set of four tires</strong>. These limited-time promotions are offered by leading brands and provide customers with an excellent opportunity to upgrade their vehicle’s tires while saving money. Rebates are usually issued as prepaid cards or online claims after purchase and vary depending on the brand, tire model, and promotion period. Taking advantage of seasonal tire rebate programs is one of the best ways to get <strong>premium tires at a lower cost</strong> while ensuring your vehicle is equipped with high-quality, reliable performance for the road ahead. See below for individual rebate deatils per brand. <br/><br/></p>",
        "credit_card_info": "",
        "apply_now_url": "",
        "credit_card_terms_url": "",
        "credit_card_terms_title": "",
        "eligibility_info": "<p><strong>Manufacturer Rebate Terms & Conditions</strong><br/><br/>Manufacturer rebate promotions advertised are offered directly by the tire manufacturers and are <strong>valid only for residents of Canada</strong>. Eligible purchases must be made within Canada during the specified promotional period and submitted according to the manufacturer’s rebate instructions. Rebates typically apply to the purchase of <strong>four (4) qualifying tires</strong> and may range between <strong>$40 and $200 depending on the brand, model, and promotion</strong>. Rebate amounts, eligibility requirements, and submission deadlines are determined by the manufacturer and are subject to change without notice.</p><p>Rebates are issued directly by the manufacturer in the form of prepaid cards, electronic transfers, or other methods specified in the promotion. <strong>Premier Tire is not responsible for the processing, approval, or fulfillment of manufacturer rebates.</strong> Customers are responsible for submitting all required documentation within the manufacturer’s deadline. Offers are <strong>void where prohibited</strong> and <strong>not valid outside of Canada</strong>.</p><p>All promotions are <strong>while supplies last and cannot be combined with certain other offers unless explicitly stated</strong>. Additional manufacturer terms and conditions may apply.</p>",
        "eligible_products_title": "CURRENT TIRE REBATES ACTIVE.",
        "redemption_info": "<p><strong>How To Redeem:</strong></p>",
        "disclaimer": "<p><em>Premier Tire can email a copy of your invoice to your email address within one to two weeks. An invoice will also be shipped with your order. (Website order placed page and order/shipment confirmation emails not accepted.) All rebate claims are the </em>responsibility<em> of the end user and should be submitted within stated acttive promo periods. </em></p><p>*Terms and conditions may apply.</p>",
